+ * history.pushState and replaceState move the address a page reports,
+ * and a browser shows that address, records it in its history and
+ * reloads it. Home Assistant puts its login code in the address it
+ * returns to and replaces it once the code is used; kept, that address
+ * was what the History page offered and what a reload fetched, and the
+ * code in it had long expired.
+ *
+ * \param bw       the window
